{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f0d57066-eb5b-86a6-84dc-f63531594406",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:29:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yeah, hi. My name is Helena Pacheco. I'm calling about the storm drain on the corner by my mother's house. It's full right to the top and it is not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get that down. Storm drain, full, not draining. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "42 Washington Street, down the Point. The drain's right on the corner, you turn at where the bank used to be and it's about two houses down from there. Sorry, hang on one second, it's loud here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm closing the door. My kids have the TV going. Can you hear me better now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better, yep. So that's 42 Washington, corner drain. When did you first notice it backing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the storm. The nor'easter, Friday into Saturday. That was three days ago and the water has not gone down. It's just sitting there, a big pond across the whole corner. And honestly it does this every time it rains hard. Nobody ever comes to clean it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Is the water up into any yards or the house, or is it mostly in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now it's the street and the edge of her yard. But my mother is in her eighties and she lives there alone, and the neighbor next door is older too. Neither of them can get out without walking through it. My mother's got a cane. She can't be wading through that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:27:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, understood. So there are a couple of older folks who can't really get out the front. I'll put that in the notes so the crew sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. I called, well, I'm calling now, but this is not the first time we've had this corner fill up. I'm just tired of it, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me read back what I have. Corner storm drain at 42 Washington Street in the Point, full and not draining since the storm Friday into Saturday, water across the corner and into the edge of the yard, elderly residents who can't get out. Anything to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. That's right. Can I ask, do the crews work on weekends? Because if nobody's coming till next week, that's another whole weekend of her stuck inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called out for weekend stuff sometimes, but I can't tell you a day for this one. The crews are slammed after a storm like that. What I can do is mark it as a priority because of the access issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd appreciate that. Because it's been three days already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, understood. Is the best callback number the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0186. That's my cell. If it goes to voicemail just leave a message, I'll call right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0186. I'll have somebody call you if they need anything else, and the crew supervisor will see this today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Helena. Take care."
    }
  ],
